Kinetic Infrastructure Layer (KIL)

This project materially builds on the Kinetic Trust Protocol (KTP) v2.0.0 RFC
series published by NMCITRA. KTP is available under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/nmcitra/ktp-rfc/tree/v2.0.0

The historical case study is based on Hugging Face's public July 2026 incident
disclosure and technical timeline. Sensitive values in those sources were
redacted or genericized by the publisher.

No license for original KIL material has been selected yet. Until one is
adopted explicitly, no license is granted for that original material.

